==English==

===Etymology===
From {{uder|en|frm|regaigner}} (French {{m|fr|regagner}}). Surface etymology is {{prefix|en|re|gain}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{q|verb}} {{IPA|en|/ɹiːˈɡeɪn/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-regain.wav|Audio (Southern England)}}
** {{rhymes|en|eɪn|s=2}}
* {{q|noun}} {{IPA|en|/ˈɹiːɡeɪn/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-regain2.wav|Audio (Southern England)}}
* {{hyph|en|re|gain}}

